                      "color": "#4B2D83"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Each dot is a department, and color identifies its business unit. The vertical axis is modeled value; the horizontal axis allocates the selected billing model's effective platform cost in proportion to observed department credits. Dots toward the top-left deliver more modeled value than allocated cost; dots toward the bottom-right cost more than they return. Open Filters & cost to choose Credit-Priced, License-Included, Prepaid, Hybrid, or Monthly Committed billing and enter the assumptions required by that model. Estimated Value $ is modeled from observed task counts, published time-per-task research, and the selected labor rate. Cost remains unavailable until observed consumption and the selected model's required inputs are present.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
